{
  "format": "Native mono/stereo 48000 Hz Opus, 192 kbps VBR, zero header gain",
  "rights": "Owner explicitly confirmed necessary rights and approved public redistribution of these selected edited derivatives in the #668 implementation session. Raw library masters and the construction-kit ISO stay private. Retain original library entitlement/licence records; media do not inherit the code licence. This clearance does not extend to unrelated legacy assets.",
  "design": "Three distinct close shots and two distinct distant shots per bank. Close and distant use the same named donor weapon. Preserve native channels, natural rate and full inter-shot decay; crop 5 ms before the first sample exceeding 1% of the local attack peak until 5 ms before the next attack, with 1 ms entrance and 80 ms exit fades. One common -3 dB offline headroom gain for every selected bank, no per-take normalization, EQ, limiting, synthetic reinforcement or additional action layers. Close/distant runtime energy references use full-clip mono energy of the edited float masters. Construction-kit Distant 02 is its authored front-of-weapon microphone perspective, not a calibrated 140 m recording.",
  "approval": "Operator approved the proposed substitute models. These are explicit authored bank assignments, not runtime fallbacks. Unsupported suppressed weapon identities remain silent.",
  "donors": {
    "rifle-suppressed": "M4 substitute: AR15 18-inch / Saker 556, 5.56 NATO. Folder says AR15, filenames say M16.",
    "mcx": "MCX unsuppressed: SIG MCX, metadata identifies 5.56 NATO; game uses subsonic .300 BLK. Provisional calibre mismatch.",
    "mcx-suppressed": "MCX suppressed substitute: Noveske 8-inch / Saker 762. Metadata identifies 5.56 NATO, NOT .300 BLK. Provisional calibre mismatch; replaces the unidentified legacy close bank with a matched donor pair.",
    "mpx": "MPX unsuppressed substitute: UZI, 9x19mm; open-bolt blowback rather than the MPX closed-bolt gas system.",
    "mpx-suppressed": "MPX suppressed substitute: HK MP5 / Octane 9, 9mm; different operating system. Replaces unidentified legacy close bank with matched donor pair.",
    "lmg-suppressed": "EVOLYS-7.62 substitute: FN SCAR 762 / Saker 762, 7.62 NATO; rifle action rather than belt-fed machine gun.",
    "sniper-suppressed": "AX338 substitute: Summit Carbon .338 / Harvester Big Bore 338, .338 Lapua Magnum bolt-action.",
    "pistol-suppressed": "P320 substitute: Glock 19 / Osprey 9 (folder spelling: Ospray), 9x19mm striker-fired short-recoil pistol.",
    "shotgun-suppressed": "M590 substitute: Remington 870 Tactical / Salvo 12, 12-gauge pump action."
  },
